{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/6","id":4900250517,"node_id":"PR_kwDON1sLX88AAAABJBPjlQ","html_url":"https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/6","diff_url":"https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/6.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/6.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/issues/6","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/6/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/6/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/issues/6/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/statuses/82e4c9927ebc713cb230cf973bd11decb93af503","number":6,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Deploy to GitHub Pages with actions/deploy-pages and verify the live site","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes #5\n\nGitHub Pages for this repository is set to **Source: GitHub Actions** (`\"build_type\": \"workflow\"` in `GET /repos/konard/konard.github.io/pages`). In that mode Pages only publishes an artifact deployed with `actions/deploy-pages`. The `deploy` job did something else: it copied `build/` into `docs/` and pushed a commit, which only works in \"Deploy from a branch\" mode. The run was green, the build went into the repository (`2c4189d` \"Deploy build to docs [skip ci]\"), and nothing reached the site.\n\nWhat is live now is the only deployment ever made: GitHub's built-in Jekyll build of `docs/` at `3d4aa8d`, from before the source was switched. At that commit `docs/` held only `case-studies/`. So `/` returns **404**, while `/case-studies/issue-1/` returns 200.\n\n### Reproduce\n```bash\ngh api repos/konard/konard.github.io/pages --jq .build_type      # workflow\ncurl -sI https://konard.github.io/ | head -1                      # HTTP/2 404\nbash scripts/check-deployed-site.sh https://konard.github.io 1 0  # fails: curl (22) 404\n```\n\n### Changes\n- **`test` job:** after the build, `actions/upload-pages-artifact@v5` uploads `build/` as the `github-pages` artifact. Pull requests upload it too, so a broken artifact fails before the merge.\n- **`deploy` job** (only on `main`, `needs: test`): runs `actions/deploy-pages@v5` in the `github-pages` environment, with `pages: write`, `id-token: write` and `contents: read`. It makes no more bot commits, so it needs no `contents: write`, no push retries and no Git credentials.\n- **No more green-but-empty deploys:** the new `scripts/check-deployed-site.sh` runs after the deployment. It requires the deployed URL to serve `<div id=\"root\"></div>` and a `/assets/index-*.js` script that loads. It bypasses the CDN cache and retries 6×10 s.\n- **`docs/`:** the stale CRA/Vite build output is removed. Only `docs/case-studies` is left.\n- **`src/workflow.test.js`:** new tests check the Pages artifact upload, `deploy-pages` with its environment and permissions, that no job commits a build, the post-deploy check, and that `docs/` holds no site build. The Node 24 minimums include the Pages actions. The obsolete \"keeps docs/case-studies when copying\" test is replaced.\n- README deployment section and comments updated.\n\n**Side effect:** the Jekyll page at `/case-studies/issue-1/` existed only because the app was missing. After the merge it is no longer served. The case study is still in the repository at [`docs/case-studies/issue-1`](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-5-e5bccd617a50/docs/case-studies/issue-1/README.md).\n\n### Analysis\nThe full root-cause analysis, alternatives and collected evidence (Pages API, builds, deployments, environment policy, CI logs) are in [`dev/log/issues/5/pulls/6/README.md`](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-5-e5bccd617a50/dev/log/issues/5/pulls/6/README.md).\n\n### Verification\n- With the **old** workflow, the new workflow tests fail (5 failures). With the fix, `npm run test:ci` passes **38/38**.\n- [`experiments/test-check-deployed-site.sh`](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-5-e5bccd617a50/experiments/test-check-deployed-site.sh): the check script accepts a locally served `build/` and rejects a server with only `docs/` (what the live site serves).\n- `npm run check`, `npm run build`, `npm audit` (0 vulnerabilities) and actionlint 1.7.12 pass locally.\n- CI run [39035273727](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/actions/runs/39035273727) is green with no warnings. Its `github-pages` artifact contains `index.html` (with `<div id=\"root\"></div>` and `/assets/index-OgCrp1wx.js`), `assets/`, the favicons and `manifest.json`.\n- **Still to verify after merge:** the `github-pages` environment only lets `main` deploy, so this PR cannot deploy. The first real deployment runs on the merge to `main`, and the \"Verify the deployed site\" step will fail that run if https://konard.github.io still does not serve the app.\n\n<!-- hive-mind:requirements:start -->\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"headSha\": \"82e4c9927ebc713cb230cf973bd11decb93af503\",\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"owner\": \"konard\",\n      \"repo\": \"konard.github.io\",\n      \"number\": 5,\n      \"sourceDigest\": \"28551b74c2f372ab2343b4e2a6d4430db14031dba596c5d1441d380ca4e6bee8\",\n      \"requirements\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Inventory every requirement in the issue description and feedback, including prose.\",\n          \"status\": \"done\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Issue #5 has only a title and no comments; PR #6 has no comments or reviews. Requirements R1-R4 are inventoried in https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-5-e5bccd617a50/dev/log/issues/5/pulls/6/README.md\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Find the root cause of konard.github.io being empty while GitHub Pages is configured to deploy from Actions\",\n          \"status\": \"done\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Pages API reports build_type=workflow (https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-5-e5bccd617a50/dev/log/issues/5/pulls/6/data/pages-api.json); the deploy job only committed build/ to docs/ and never called actions/deploy-pages (run 39029889455 log); the only live deployment is a Jekyll build of docs/ at 3d4aa8d containing only case-studies, so / returns 404 (data/site-before-status.txt)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Workflow publishes the tested build to GitHub Pages from Actions (upload-pages-artifact + deploy-pages)\",\n          \"status\": \"done\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Commit 83916e3 changes .github/workflows/github-pages.yml: the test job runs actions/upload-pages-artifact@v5 on build/, and the deploy job runs actions/deploy-pages@v5 in the github-pages environment with pages/id-token write. CI run https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/actions/runs/39035273727 is green; its github-pages artifact contains index.html with <div id=\\\"root\\\"></div> and /assets/index-OgCrp1wx.js\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"A deploy that leaves the site empty fails CI instead of looking green\",\n          \"status\": \"done\",\n          \"evidence\": \"scripts/check-deployed-site.sh runs after deploy-pages. experiments/test-check-deployed-site.sh shows it accepts a served build/ and rejects a docs-only server; run against the live site it fails with 404. Covered by the test 'deploy fails unless the deployed URL serves the app' in src/workflow.test.js\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Automated tests reproduce the bug and verify the fix\",\n          \"status\": \"done\",\n          \"evidence\": \"With the old workflow, the new tests in src/workflow.test.js fail (5 failures); with the fix, npm run test:ci passes 38/38 locally and in CI run 39035273727\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"Keep the existing CI guarantees and remove the stale build from docs/ while keeping docs/case-studies\",\n          \"status\": \"done\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Tests for job timeouts, read-only default permissions, Node 24 action minimums (now including the Pages actions), uncancelled main deploys and publishing the tested build all pass. docs/ now holds only case-studies, checked by the test 'docs/ holds no stale site build'\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"https://konard.github.io actually serves the site (not empty)\",\n          \"status\": \"blocked\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Needs this PR merged to main: the github-pages environment only lets main deploy (dev/log/issues/5/pulls/6/data/github-pages-branch-policies.json), and the deploy job is gated to refs/heads/main, so a PR branch cannot deploy. After the merge, the 'Verify the deployed site' step checks the live URL and fails the run if the app is not served\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n<!-- hive-mind:requirements:end -->\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-17T12:59:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:58:33Z","closed_at":"2026-10-17T14:58:32Z","merged_at":"2026-10-17T14:58:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"727a817b2f8d015a1555c9d618ffa6716aaf4b5c","assignee":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"reques